msgstr "Application volume %u%%"

#: src/associations.c:57
msgid "窗口缺少可保存的窗口类，或所选桌面文件无效。"
msgstr ""
"The window has no reusable class, or the selected desktop file is invalid."

#: src/associations.c:88
msgid "窗口已关闭，请为仍在运行的窗口设置关联。"
msgstr ""
"The window has closed. Set an association for a window that is still running."

#: src/associations.c:104
msgid "选择关联应用的桌面文件"
msgstr "Select the application desktop file"

#: src/associations.c:105
msgid "关联"
msgstr "Associate"

#: src/associations.c:107
msgid "应用启动器 (*.desktop)"
msgstr "Application launchers (*.desktop)"

#: src/associations.c:113
msgid ""
"此规则适用于相同窗口类的所有窗口。\n"
"窗口类完全相同的多配置应用仍需要应用自身提供不同身份。"
msgstr ""
"This rule applies to all windows with the same window class.\n"
"Profiles with identical window classes still need distinct identities from "
"the application."

#: src/layout.c:46
#, c-format
msgid "更多窗口与启动器（%u）"
msgstr "More windows and launchers (%u)"
